\n@r10 syntax.relation from=$c1 to=$c2\n@r11 syntax.relation from=$c1 to=$c8\n@r12 syntax.relation from=$n2 to=$c3\n@r13 syntax.relation from=$n8 to=$c5\n@r14 syntax.relation from=$n8 to=$c6\n\n=== n=108 ===\nTEXT: I want the Draft box split into two boxes side by side, with the incoming arrow on the left one and the outgoing arrow on the right\nSOP:\n@n1 syntax.nominal head=\"I\"\n@c1 syntax.clause form=declarative verb=\"want\" subject=$n1\n@n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"Draft\" head=\"box\"\n@c2 syntax.clause form=nonfinite verb=\"split\" subject=$n2\n@r1 syntax.relation marker=\"into\" from=$c2 to=$n3\n@n3 syntax.nominal dependent=\"two\" head=\"boxes\"\n@n4 syntax.nominal head=\"side\"\n@r2 syntax.relation marker=\"by\" from=$n4 to=$n5\n@n5 syntax.nominal head=\"side\"\n@r3 syntax.relation marker=\"with\" from=$n3 to=$k1\n@n6 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"incoming\" head=\"arrow\"\n@r4 syntax.relation marker=\"on\" from=$n6 to=$n7\n@n7 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"left\" head=\"one\"\n@k1 syntax.coordination conjunction=\"and\" conjunct=$n6 conjunct=$n8\n@n8 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"outgoing\" head=\"arrow\"\n@r5 syntax.relation marker=\"on\" from=$n8 to=$n9\n@n9 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"right\"\n@r6 syntax.relation from=$c1 to=$c2\n@r7 syntax.relation from=$n3 to=$n4\n\n=== n=109 ===\nTEXT: create a doughnut chart called Sales 7 for Jan and Feb with datasets [{\"label\": \"North\", \"data\": [7, 9]}, {\"label\": \"South\", \"data\": [8, 10]}]\nSOP:\n@c1 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"create\" complement=$n1\n@n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"a\" dependent=\"doughnut\" head=\"chart\"\n@c2 syntax.clause form=nonfinite verb=\"called\" complement=$n2\n@n2 syntax.nominal head=\"Sales\"\n@n3 syntax.nominal head=\"7\"\n@r1 syntax.relation marker=\"for\" from=$n2 to=$k1\n@n4 syntax.nominal head=\"Jan\"\n@k1 syntax.coordination conjunction=\"and\" conjunct=$n4 conjunct=$n5\n@n5 syntax.nominal head=\"Feb\"\n@r2 syntax.relation marker=\"with\" from=$n1 to=$n6\n@n6 syntax.nominal head=\"datasets\"\n@n7 syntax.nominal dependent=\"label\" dependent=\"North\" head=\"data\"\n@n8 syntax.nominal head=\"7\"\n@n9 syntax.nominal head=\"9\"\n@n10 syntax.nominal head=\"label\"\n@n11 syntax.nominal head=\"South\"\n@n12 syntax.nominal head=\"data\"\n@n13 syntax.nominal head=\"8\"\n@n14 syntax.nominal head=\"10\"\n@r3 syntax.relation from=$n1 to=$c2\n@r4 syntax.relation from=$n2 to=$n3\n@r5 syntax.relation from=$n6 to=$n7\n@r6 syntax.relation from=$n7 to=$n8\n@r7 syntax.relation from=$n7 to=$n10\n@r8 syntax.relation from=$n8 to=$n9\n@r9 syntax.relation from=$n10 to=$n11\n@r10 syntax.relation from=$n10 to=$n12\n@r11 syntax.relation from=$n12 to=$n13\n@r12 syntax.relation from=$n13 to=$n14\n\n=== n=110 ===\nTEXT: while you're there, I want the marker interval 3 on the revenue trend and I'd like the series name Trajectory on the revenue trend\nSOP:\n@r1 syntax.relation marker=\"while\" from=$c2 to=$c1\n@n1 syntax.nominal head=\"you\"\n@c1 syntax.clause form=declarative verb=\"'re\" modifier=\"there\" subject=$n1\n@n2 syntax.nominal head=\"I\"\n@c2 syntax.clause form=declarative verb=\"want\" subject=$n2 complement=$n3\n@n3 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"marker\" head=\"interval\"\n@n4 syntax.nominal head=\"3\"\n@r2 syntax.relation marker=\"on\" from=$n3 to=$n5\n@n5 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"revenue\" head=\"trend\"\n@k1 syntax.coordination conjunction=\"and\" conjunct=$c2 conjunct=$c3\n@n6 syntax.nominal head=\"I\"\n@c3 syntax.clause form=declarative auxiliary=\"'d\" verb=\"like\" subject=$n6 complement=$n7\n@n7 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"series\" head=\"name\"\n@n8 syntax.nominal head=\"Trajectory\"\n@r3 syntax.relation marker=\"on\" from=$c3 to=$n9\n@n9 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"revenue\" head=\"trend\"\n@r4 syntax.relation from=$n3 to=$n4\n@r5 syntax.relation from=$n7 to=$n8\n\n=== n=111 ===\