ation conjunction=\"but\" conjunct=$c1 conjunct=$c2\n@c2 syntax.clause form=fragment modifier=\"not\" modifier=\"left\" ellipsis=$c1\n@r2 syntax.relation marker=\"to\" from=$c2 to=$n4\n@n4 syntax.nominal head=\"right\"\n@r3 syntax.relation marker=\"so\" from=$c1 to=$c3\n@n5 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"bow\"\n@c3 syntax.clause form=declarative modifier=\"still\" verb=\"points\" subject=$n5\n@r4 syntax.relation marker=\"at\" from=$c3 to=$n6\n@n6 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"harbour\"\n\n=== n=115 ===\nTEXT: for the monthly ops review on Friday I need the revenue trend legible from the back of the conference room, so make the reference line dashed, grey and horizontal before we circulate it wider and then make the font a bit bigger\nSOP:\n@r1 syntax.relation marker=\"for\" from=$c1 to=$n1\n@n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"monthly\" dependent=\"ops\" head=\"review\"\n@r2 syntax.relation marker=\"on\" from=$n1 to=$n2\n@n2 syntax.nominal head=\"Friday\"\n@n3 syntax.nominal head=\"I\"\n@c1 syntax.clause form=declarative verb=\"need\" modifier=\"legible\" subject=$n3 complement=$n4\n@n4 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"revenue\" head=\"trend\"\n@r3 syntax.relation marker=\"from\" from=$c1 to=$n5\n@n5 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"back\"\n@r4 syntax.relation marker=\"of\" from=$n5 to=$n6\n@n6 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"conference\" head=\"room\"\n@c2 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"make\" modifier=\"dashed\" modifier=\"grey\" discourse=\"and\" modifier=\"horizontal\" complement=$n7\n@k1 syntax.coordination conjunction=\"so\" conjunction=\"and\" conjunct=$c1 conjunct=$c2 conjunct=$c4\n@n7 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"reference\" head=\"line\"\n@r5 syntax.relation marker=\"before\" from=$c2 to=$c3\n@n8 syntax.nominal head=\"we\"\n@c3 syntax.clause form=declarative verb=\"circulate\" modifier=\"wider\" subject=$n8 complement=$n9\n@n9 syntax.nominal head=\"it\"\n@c4 syntax.clause form=imperative modifier=\"then\" verb=\"make\" modifier=\"bigger\" complement=$n10 complement=$n11\n@n10 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"font\"\n@n11 syntax.nominal dependent=\"a\" head=\"bit\"\n\n=== n=116 ===\nTEXT: one pie chart, the wedges rides 30%, repairs 25%, spares 45%\nSOP:\n@n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"one\" dependent=\"pie\" head=\"chart\"\n@n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"wedges\"\n@c1 syntax.clause form=declarative verb=\"rides\" subject=$n2 complement=$n3\n@n3 syntax.nominal dependent=\"30\" head=\"%\"\n@c2 syntax.clause form=declarative verb=\"repairs\" complement=$n4\n@n4 syntax.nominal dependent=\"25\" head=\"%\"\n@c3 syntax.clause form=declarative verb=\"spares\" complement=$n5\n@n5 syntax.nominal dependent=\"45\" head=\"%\"\n@c4 syntax.clause form=fragment complement=$n1\n@k1 syntax.coordination conjunct=$c4 conjunct=$c1 conjunct=$c2 conjunct=$c3\n\n=== n=117 ===\nTEXT: Could you what values does Lunch orders show?. Thanks!\nSOP:\n@c1 syntax.clause form=interrogative verb=\"Could\" subject=$n1\n@n1 syntax.nominal head=\"you\"\n@n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"what\" head=\"values\"\n@c2 syntax.clause form=interrogative auxiliary=\"does\" verb=\"show\" subject=$n3 complement=$n2\n@n3 syntax.nominal dependent=\"Lunch\" head=\"orders\"\n@c3 syntax.clause form=fragment discourse=\"Thanks\"\n@k1 syntax.coordination conjunct=$c1 conjunct=$c2\n\n=== n=118 ===\nTEXT: please to insert a picture of the old culvert and move it to the right corner\nSOP:\n@c1 syntax.clause form=fragment discourse=\"please\"\n@r1 syntax.relation marker=\"to\" from=$c1 to=$k1\n@c2 syntax.clause form=nonfinite verb=\"insert\" complement=$n1\n@n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"a\" head=\"picture\"\n@r2 syntax.relation marker=\"of\" from=$n1 to=$n2\n@n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"old\" head=\"culvert\"\n@k1 syntax.coordination conjunction=\"and\" conjunct=$c2 conjunct=$c3\n@c3 syntax.clause form=nonfinite verb=\"move\" complement=$n3\n@n3 syntax.nominal head=\"it\"\n@r3 syntax.relation marker=\"to\" from=$c3 to=$n4\n@n4 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"right\" head=\"corner\"\n\n=== n=119 ===\nTEXT: set the bend of arrow from Start to Review to 26 and the x to 120 and the y to 80\nSOP:\n@c1 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"set\" complement=$n1\n@n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"bend\"\n@r1 syntax.relation marker=\"of\" from=$n1 to=$n2\n@n2 syntax.nominal head=\"arrow\"\n@r2 syntax.relation marker=\"from\" from=$n1 to=$n3\n@n3 syntax.nominal head=\"Start\"\n@r3 syntax.relation marker=\"to\" from=$n3 to=$n4\n@n4 syntax.nominal head=\"Review\"\n@r4 syntax.relation attachment=ambiguous marker=\"to\" from=$c1 to=$n5\n@n5 syntax.nominal head=\"26\"\n@k1 syntax.coordination conjunction=\"and\" conjunction=\"and\" conjunct=$c1 conjunct=$c2\n@n6 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"x\"\n@r5 syntax.relation marker=\"to\" from=$n6 to=$n7\n@n7 syntax.nominal head=\"120\"\n@n8 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"y\"\n@r6 syntax.relation marker=\"to\" from=$n8 to=$n9\n@n9 syntax.nominal head=\"80\"\n@c2 syntax.clause form=fragment complement=$k2 ellipsis=$c1\n@k2 syntax.coordination conjunct=$n6 conjunct=$n8\n\n=== n=120 ===\nTEXT: add a cat 260 Take 2\nSOP:\n@c1 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"add\" complement=$n1\n@n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"a\" head=\"cat\"\n@n2 syntax.nominal head=\"260\"\n@c2 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"Take\" complement=$n2 complement=$n3\n@n3 syntax.nominal head=\"2\"\n@k1 syntax.coordination conjunct=$c1 conjunct=$c2\n\n=== n=121 ===\nTEXT: draw the diagram, then check the profit area is above zero\nSOP:\n@c1 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"draw\" complement=$n1\n@n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"diagram\"\n@k1 syntax.coordination conjunction=\"then\" conjunct=$c1 conjunct=$c2\n@c2 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"check\"\n@n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"profit\" head=\"area\"\n@c3 syntax.clause form=declarative 